<view class="page review-page">
  <view class="page-header"><text class="kicker">让不会的，慢慢变会</text><text class="page-title review-title">复习，有的放矢。</text><text class="page-subtitle">从最需要巩固的地方开始，一次解决一点。</text></view>
  <view class="card metrics"><view class="metric"><text class="metric-value">{{summary.dueCount}}</text><text class="metric-label">到期复习</text></view><view class="metric"><text class="metric-value">{{summary.activeWrongCount}}</text><text class="metric-label">待巩固</text></view><view class="metric"><text class="metric-value">{{summary.masteredCount}}</text><text class="metric-label">已掌握</text></view></view>
  <view wx:if="{{summary.activeWrongCount}}" class="review-focus"><text class="section-title">从今日安排开始</text><text class="status-note">优先复习到期内容，再学习新知识。答对后按次日、3 天、7 天逐步巩固。</text><button class="primary-button" bindtap="onStartWrong">继续今日学习</button></view>
  <view wx:else class="section"><ui-state mark="✓" title="{{summary.attempts ? '当前错题已巩固' : '从第一次练习开始'}}" description="{{summary.attempts ? '继续练习，检验其他专项。已巩固记录仍可在分类里查看。' : '完成练习后，这里会帮你找到薄弱项。暂无记录时不计算正确率。'}}" action="去专项练习" bind:action="onPractice" /></view>
  <view wx:if="{{weakTopics.length}}" class="section"><view class="section-heading"><text class="section-title">优先巩固</text><text class="section-note">按待巩固知识数</text></view><view class="stack"><ui-entry wx:for="{{weakTopics}}" wx:key="id" title="{{item.name}}" meta="到期 {{item.dueCount}} 项 · 待巩固 {{item.activeWrongCount}} 项" data-id="{{item.id}}" bind:activate="onOpenTopic" /></view></view>
  <view class="section"><view class="section-heading"><text class="section-title">全部模块</text><text class="section-note">累计作答 {{summary.attempts}} 次</text></view><view class="stack"><ui-entry wx:for="{{moduleStats}}" wx:key="id" title="{{item.name}}" symbol="{{item.symbol}}" meta="{{item.meta}}" badge="{{item.badge}}" warning="{{item.activeWrongCount > 0}}" data-id="{{item.id}}" bind:activate="onOpenModule" /></view></view>
  <text class="data-note">浏览进度与答题表现分别统计。以上为累计数据，不代表近期成绩趋势。</text>
  <button wx:if="{{summary.attempts}}" class="text-button clear-button" bindtap="onClearStats">管理学习数据 ›</button>
</view>
